      "writtenOn": "2021-12-01T18:39:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m looking at the various comments, but my first thing was to address the failures in serialize-8888. Sadly, this is EXTREMELY difficult, given how Skia has operated for a long time. SkImage::MakeFromEncoded *always* produces a premul image, and this can\u0027t be overridden via an API. (It\u0027s hard-coded behavior in SkCodecImageGenerator.cpp - adjust_info()). Trying to come up with options, because it means that you can\u0027t serialize an unpremul image (shader) at all, and get the results you want on the receiving end.",
      "revId": "a72ad89c5a42823f12f5f0ab2c87a29bfd7ea425",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
